WEBVTT

00:06.980 --> 00:11.490
Prince of Tanaka
Shiny Diamond

00:07.900 --> 00:09.770
Dai-chan, you're so cute!

00:09.770 --> 00:11.490
It looks so good on you!

00:11.990 --> 00:14.640
<i>Dai-chan is the kitten that 
was picked up by Yukichi</i>

00:14.640 --> 00:17.490
<i>and Chief Orizuka's niece, Yume-chan.</i>

00:19.110 --> 00:20.710
This kitten!

00:34.250 --> 00:36.340
I should take a picture!

00:36.340 --> 00:39.430
You're definitely going to 
gain more followers!

00:41.470 --> 00:47.480
<b>Heh</b>

00:44.480 --> 00:47.480
<b>Ideal</b>

00:47.520 --> 00:49.440
<b><i>Rip Rip Rip
Tear</i></b>

00:48.230 --> 00:49.440
Dai-chan?!

00:49.440 --> 00:51.210
It looked so good on you!

00:51.210 --> 00:52.440
Do you hate wearing clothes?!

00:52.490 --> 00:56.950
<b>Whine</b>

00:53.150 --> 00:56.950
Goodness, I worked so hard to make this!

00:57.490 --> 01:00.950
<b>Stare...</b>

00:57.930 --> 01:00.950
It's completely torn up! Can I fix this?

01:00.950 --> 01:03.450
<b>Stare</b>

01:03.500 --> 01:05.460
Ideal

01:04.460 --> 01:05.460
<b>Heh</b>

01:05.460 --> 01:07.040
Clamp

01:06.720 --> 01:09.260
What?! What's wrong with you, Dai-chan?

01:10.040 --> 01:12.550
Oh! You want to play with my apron?

01:12.550 --> 01:13.680
There!

01:16.220 --> 01:18.550
He's chasing after it 
more than his toy mouse!

01:18.720 --> 01:21.060
<b>Rise</b>

01:20.030 --> 01:23.760
Dai-chan, are you practicing again?

01:23.760 --> 01:25.560
Hold on! I need to record it!

01:26.790 --> 01:30.560
Okay! Dai-chan is practicing today, too.

01:30.560 --> 01:32.070
<b>Shake</b>

01:30.560 --> 01:32.070
<b>Shake</b>

01:32.070 --> 01:38.070
<b>Step</b>

01:34.070 --> 01:38.070
<b>Shake</b>

01:34.320 --> 01:38.070
Goal

01:35.990 --> 01:38.070
<b>Shake</b>

01:36.700 --> 01:38.070
<b>Nyop</b>

01:36.780 --> 01:38.070
<b>Hmph!!</b>

01:38.070 --> 01:41.080
D-Dai-chan, did you just take a step?!

01:41.080 --> 01:42.920
No way! You're a genius!

01:42.580 --> 01:45.080
<b><b>Ring...</b></b>

01:42.920 --> 01:45.530
We might even get on TV!

01:45.530 --> 01:47.270
I'm so glad I recorded it!

01:47.270 --> 01:49.080
You're amazing, Dai-chan!

01:53.090 --> 01:57.590
<b>He walked!?!?</b>

01:54.710 --> 01:57.590
Saku-senpai, have you seen this kitty?

01:58.480 --> 01:59.900
Kitty?

01:59.900 --> 02:02.100
He's been trending on Ista!

02:02.100 --> 02:04.220
<b>He walked!?!?</b>

02:02.100 --> 02:04.690
He's a cat that stands on two legs!

02:04.690 --> 02:05.470
Huh?!

02:05.470 --> 02:10.460
It seems like he's even 
learning how to walk...

02:11.310 --> 02:13.980
Whoa! You're right! He's trying to walk.

02:13.980 --> 02:15.370
That's amazing!

02:15.370 --> 02:17.520
It's way too cute!

02:17.520 --> 02:19.990
<i>Thank goodness. It wasn't Yukichi...</i>

02:21.060 --> 02:23.140
I wonder if they'll publish a photo book!

02:23.140 --> 02:25.130
<i>Cats that walk on two legs...</i>

02:25.130 --> 02:27.050
<i>I guess it's more common than I thought.</i>

02:27.960 --> 02:29.790
<i>I didn't know.</i>

02:46.810 --> 02:53.980
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

04:00.970 --> 04:04.640
Can

04:00.970 --> 04:04.640
<b>The Masterful Cat Is Depressed Tomorrow As Well</b>

04:04.760 --> 04:05.970
<b>The Masterful Cat Is Depressed Tomorrow As Well</b>

04:04.840 --> 04:05.970
Can

04:06.370 --> 04:07.520
Lately...

04:22.580 --> 04:24.560
Here, Yuki-chan!

04:25.860 --> 04:28.490
It's a present from the UMYU-Sea show!

04:29.100 --> 04:32.500
Why do you like Sea Bunny-chan 
the best, Yuki-chan?

04:32.920 --> 04:35.310
Is it 'cause she's in the middle?

04:39.110 --> 04:41.010
<i>The stuff I make</i>

04:41.470 --> 04:43.900
is something that even 
little kids can make!

04:43.900 --> 04:46.590
It's the most powerful food on Earth!

04:53.070 --> 04:54.370
Oh, yeah!

04:54.370 --> 04:56.430
Do you wanna see a recording of the show?

04:56.430 --> 04:59.270
They allowed cameras this time!

04:59.270 --> 05:03.830
<i>All good kids have nothing 
to fear now that we're here!</i>

05:03.830 --> 05:05.280
<i>UMYU-Sea!</i>

05:05.280 --> 05:10.530
<i>Help us power up while Ao-chan keeps 
the Gairai Beasts frozen in time!</i>

05:06.350 --> 05:09.080
Sorry! My voice is really loud!

05:10.840 --> 05:16.540
I'm making the world's most 
powerful food today, rice balls!

05:17.960 --> 05:20.650
You really love rice balls, Sea Bunny.

05:21.220 --> 05:23.960
Is it because you have 
the same color scheme?

05:23.960 --> 05:25.600
<i>That's not it!</i>

05:25.600 --> 05:28.760
<i>You can put all sorts 
of things into rice balls!</i>

05:28.760 --> 05:30.970
<i>All sorts? You mean, ingredients?</i>

05:32.970 --> 05:37.480
No! Feelings! The power to cheer someone on!

05:37.520 --> 05:38.980
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

05:39.980 --> 05:42.810
<i>"Don't lose! I'm right beside you!"</i>

05:42.810 --> 05:44.010
<i>Stuff like that!</i>

05:44.950 --> 05:49.400
<i>Kids with small hands can just 
put the rice in a cup and shake!</i>

05:49.990 --> 05:53.990
Let's shake it up while 
thinking, "You can do it!"

06:00.500 --> 06:02.380
Rice balls are so tasty!

06:02.380 --> 06:04.520
I love bonito flake rice balls!

06:04.520 --> 06:08.010
Squeeze! Squeeze! You can do it! 
Squeeze! Squeeze!

06:08.010 --> 06:13.510
<b>Went shopping at the supermarket</b>

06:08.520 --> 06:10.390
See you later!

06:10.390 --> 06:13.060
Thank you very much!

06:14.540 --> 06:16.240
<i>Thank you very much.</i>

06:20.900 --> 06:24.070
Morning, Yukichi.

06:24.070 --> 06:25.650
Where's the thing?

06:27.570 --> 06:30.070
Oh, that's it! Thanks!

06:30.070 --> 06:33.600
Yukichi, put that on! 
The thing we watched yesterday...

06:33.600 --> 06:34.830
What was it again?

06:36.500 --> 06:38.330
Thanks! That's it!

06:39.170 --> 06:41.140
Yukichi, that thing...

06:41.140 --> 06:42.340
The thing over there...

06:42.340 --> 06:43.480
This's it!

06:43.480 --> 06:45.190
Yukichi!

07:05.440 --> 07:09.300
Do you forget how to speak 
Japanese over the weekend?

07:09.300 --> 07:11.450
Just how little are you speaking?

07:12.130 --> 07:15.080
I can't come up with any 
nouns for some reason.

07:15.080 --> 07:17.190
Want to go to a singles meetup?

07:17.190 --> 07:18.940
That's dangerous.

07:18.940 --> 07:21.160
You're going to start 
forgetting important things

07:21.160 --> 07:23.860
and eventually forget how 
to use your vocal cords.

07:23.860 --> 07:26.470
What?! It's not that bad!

07:26.470 --> 07:29.470
It's not like I'm not talking 
at all. My vocal cords still work!

07:29.470 --> 07:31.970
Who do you talk to when you're living alone?

07:31.970 --> 07:33.010
Oh!

07:33.010 --> 07:33.840
Huh?

07:33.840 --> 07:36.800
Your cat. You must be talking to your cat!

07:36.800 --> 07:38.600
I-Isn't that normal?!

07:38.600 --> 07:40.190
You're in trouble!

07:40.190 --> 07:43.100
At this rate, you'll start 
talking to the TV, too!

07:43.100 --> 07:44.260
How rude!

07:44.260 --> 07:45.610
I don't talk to myself...

07:46.150 --> 07:48.610
And then! And then!

07:47.400 --> 07:48.610
<i>One-way conversation.</i>

07:49.770 --> 07:51.530
Actually, maybe I do talk to myself...

07:51.530 --> 07:52.860
What do you mean maybe?!

07:53.180 --> 07:55.850
If you aren't careful, 
you're going to go senile!

07:56.810 --> 07:59.140
<i>The rapid-service train will soon arrive.</i>

08:04.690 --> 08:05.960
<i>Come to think of it,</i>

08:05.960 --> 08:11.820
I've heard of people using their 
smartphone's AI to practice talking!

08:11.820 --> 08:12.880
Give it a try!

08:13.560 --> 08:16.190
Okay! H-Hey, Siro!

08:16.190 --> 08:17.120
<i>Hello.</i>

08:17.470 --> 08:18.890
Uh...

08:18.890 --> 08:21.780
<i>I'm sorry. I didn't quite hear you.</i>

08:21.780 --> 08:23.890
<i>I can't think of a question to ask!</i>

08:24.360 --> 08:28.150
Hey, Yukichi! What should I ask Siro?

08:24.670 --> 08:27.330
<i>I'm sorry. I don't understand.</i>

08:30.040 --> 08:34.450
That's right! The goal is to 
prevent my mind from slowing down!

08:33.900 --> 08:38.160
<b>Ta-dah</b>

08:34.450 --> 08:37.450
I should just play a game that uses my brain!

08:38.610 --> 08:40.600
Let's fight fair and square, Yukichi!

08:40.600 --> 08:42.020
<i>Concentration.</i>

08:42.020 --> 08:45.170
Rock, paper, and scissors!

08:45.170 --> 08:46.670
I won!

08:48.740 --> 08:51.670
You can keep the cards 
if the numbers match.

08:52.170 --> 08:53.670
Well, then!

08:54.510 --> 08:57.380
Here and here!

08:57.680 --> 08:59.890
Oh, I failed.

09:01.590 --> 09:03.410
Your turn, Yukichi!

09:08.190 --> 09:09.220
Oh, that's right!

09:09.220 --> 09:10.310
Just like that!

09:10.310 --> 09:11.830
Oh, you're good!

09:11.830 --> 09:12.690
Right! Right!

09:16.310 --> 09:17.800
<i>Complete victory.</i>

09:17.200 --> 09:17.700
<b>Ugh...</b>

09:17.800 --> 09:19.220
O-One more time...

09:27.050 --> 09:28.900
<i>Complete victory two.</i>

09:29.950 --> 09:32.820
Let's try a different game...

09:33.630 --> 09:35.340
I'm going to go buy some!

09:35.840 --> 09:37.490
<i>Six hours later.</i>

09:37.490 --> 09:39.600
Okay, I should just give up.

09:42.350 --> 09:47.600
Whether you win or lose, they say
 it still trains your brain...

09:49.400 --> 09:52.350
But it's no fun if 
I have no chance at winning!

09:52.350 --> 09:53.770
I lost every game!

09:53.230 --> 09:58.740
Weep

09:53.770 --> 09:58.740
Please take care of me if 
I go senile at my age, Yukichi!

09:59.140 --> 10:04.240
I mean, you know exactly what I mean 
when I say "this" or "that" all the time...

10:04.630 --> 10:08.450
I don't properly talk at all 
during the weekend, right?

10:09.600 --> 10:13.380
I'm forgetting how to speak 
Japanese over the weekend.

10:13.550 --> 10:15.380
<b>Chill</b>

10:16.460 --> 10:17.790
We're still going to play?!

10:19.470 --> 10:23.360
<i>Yukichi's spartan brain training 
lasted until late into the night.</i>

10:24.850 --> 10:26.540
<i>Afterwards...</i>

10:28.260 --> 10:29.590
<i>Saury rice.</i>

10:29.940 --> 10:32.020
<i>...there was a sharp increase...</i>

10:33.380 --> 10:35.030
<i>Sardine ball soup.</i>

10:35.350 --> 10:36.920
<i>...in fatty fish dishes.</i>

10:38.630 --> 10:40.280
<i>Yellowtail and daikon.</i>

10:40.610 --> 10:42.490
Sip...

10:41.970 --> 10:43.010
So good!

10:43.010 --> 10:45.920
You're really into cooking fish lately!

10:51.250 --> 10:53.040
<b>Gloom</b>

10:53.040 --> 10:56.550
I'm sorry. I'm really sorry.

10:57.050 --> 10:59.100
It's okay, Yuri-chan.

10:59.100 --> 11:02.890
Everyone'll forget a little 
mistake like that right away...

11:02.890 --> 11:07.460
It was a little scary, but we 
managed to fix it before shipment.

11:07.460 --> 11:08.930
Safe! Safe!

11:08.930 --> 11:09.830
Yeah.

11:09.830 --> 11:13.970
And I got the rare chance to see our cool 
and competent newbie on the verge of tears! {Note: In other words, it's a face she'd never imagine seeing on someone who usually never makes mistakes.}

11:13.970 --> 11:14.940
Oshiro-san!

11:15.510 --> 11:19.820
C-Come on! How about a bite 
of something from my lunch box?

11:20.220 --> 11:21.820
What do you have?

11:22.210 --> 11:26.080
Today I have fried ham cutlets, 
carrots and burdock root,

11:26.080 --> 11:27.790
and egg omelet!

11:29.750 --> 11:32.040
Egg omelet?

11:32.040 --> 11:34.170
She responded! The egg omelet!

11:34.170 --> 11:35.150
Stuff it in her mouth!

11:35.150 --> 11:36.340
Yes, sir!

11:39.340 --> 11:45.350
<b>Munch</b>

11:40.330 --> 11:42.420
It's delicious.

11:42.420 --> 11:45.350
Good for you! Cheer up!

11:46.000 --> 11:48.520
Give me a bite, too!

11:48.520 --> 11:50.420
You too, Oshiro-san?!

11:50.420 --> 11:55.150
Well, the way you eat your food 
makes it seem so delicious!

11:55.150 --> 11:58.280
I've always wanted to taste your food.

11:59.200 --> 12:00.440
Here you go.

12:00.440 --> 12:04.640
Thanks for the bite!

12:07.610 --> 12:09.540
It's really good!

12:09.540 --> 12:11.910
This is amazing, Fukuzawa!

12:13.510 --> 12:14.790
Right?

12:14.790 --> 12:16.840
Teach me how to make it.

12:16.840 --> 12:17.250
<b>Spurt</b>

12:18.570 --> 12:20.390
Please teach me, too!

12:20.390 --> 12:21.160
Huh?

12:20.460 --> 12:21.050
<b>Flinch</b>

12:21.160 --> 12:22.830
Who taught you how to cook?

12:22.830 --> 12:23.470
Well...

12:23.470 --> 12:26.470
<i>It's over. I need to come clean!</i>

12:26.470 --> 12:27.470
Saku-senpai?

12:27.470 --> 12:33.480
Shake

12:27.470 --> 12:34.140
<i>My cat is the one who makes 
these meals! I can't cook at all!</i>

12:34.500 --> 12:39.160
I-I don't really know how to make it...

12:39.650 --> 12:40.850
Huh?

12:40.850 --> 12:43.770
So you just eyeball 
the amount of ingredients?!

12:43.770 --> 12:45.430
You're like a highly-skilled chef!

12:45.430 --> 12:46.610
That's amazing!

12:46.610 --> 12:47.740
<i>What?!</i>

12:48.400 --> 12:51.750
<i>This train will stop at each 
stop until its destination.</i>

12:56.570 --> 12:58.600
So...

12:59.250 --> 13:02.760
In order to turn a lie into truth,

13:02.760 --> 13:06.700
will you teach my lowly self 
how to make egg omelets?

13:08.930 --> 13:11.930
<b>Sugar</b>

13:08.930 --> 13:11.930
<b>Soy Sauce</b>

13:08.930 --> 13:11.930
<b>Salt</b>

13:08.930 --> 13:11.930
<b>Egg</b>

13:09.550 --> 13:11.220
So these must be the ingredients!

13:12.740 --> 13:13.560
Mayo?!

13:13.560 --> 13:15.940
Okay, what are the steps?

13:16.440 --> 13:16.980
<b>Zhup</b>

13:16.980 --> 13:17.850
Huh?!

13:17.850 --> 13:19.440
Wait! How much of each?!

13:19.770 --> 13:20.270
Splurt

13:20.060 --> 13:21.440
Whoa! What?!

13:22.590 --> 13:24.440
How much was that?!

13:24.880 --> 13:28.950
You've been eyeballing everything, Yukichi?!

13:28.990 --> 13:32.700
<b>11:02 PM</b>

13:29.350 --> 13:31.360
<i>How to make egg omelets.</i>

13:31.360 --> 13:32.870
<i>First, the ingredients.</i>

13:32.870 --> 13:35.520
<i>Two eggs, a zhup of sugar, a sa-sup of salt,</i>

13:35.520 --> 13:37.710
<i>a squeeze of mayo, 
and a tap tap of soy sauce.</i>

13:37.710 --> 13:39.050
<i>No one can understand that!</i>

13:37.960 --> 13:40.840
<b>11:12 PM</b>

13:39.050 --> 13:40.430
<i>Do it again!</i>

13:49.390 --> 13:54.390
<i>A great many of the creatures known 
as cats live below this vast sky.</i>

13:55.310 --> 14:02.050
<i>But how many cats take out the trash 
in their owner's stead?</i>

14:03.910 --> 14:06.240
<i>She didn't ask me to do it.</i>

14:06.240 --> 14:08.910
<i>And I'm not saying she needs to thank me...</i>

14:12.960 --> 14:15.990
I'll fix it by morning...

14:13.740 --> 14:16.500
<b>Dum...</b>

14:14.340 --> 14:16.220
<i>At least notice the change!</i>

14:15.540 --> 14:19.000
<b>* She kept pillows and a blanket at the entrance just
 in case she fell asleep there and it became a habit.</b>

14:16.220 --> 14:19.000
<i>Why is she still sleeping at the front 
entrance when there's so much more space?!</i>

14:20.210 --> 14:21.500
<i>No! No!</i>

14:21.930 --> 14:25.090
<i>I have to take out the trash 
as quickly as possible!</i>

14:25.090 --> 14:27.600
<i>Otherwise, </i>he'll<i> appear after dawn breaks.</i>

14:28.050 --> 14:30.540
<i>That noisy old man...</i>

14:34.010 --> 14:37.320
You're here again! You stupid cat!

14:37.860 --> 14:43.980
<i>This human named Landlord has claimed 
this trash area as his territory!</i>

14:44.300 --> 14:46.470
<i>It may be because he dislikes cats,</i>

14:44.550 --> 14:48.200
Goodness, you keep coming back 
no matter how many times I shoo you off!

14:46.500 --> 14:51.490
<i>but this old man always causes trouble 
for me as soon as he sees me!</i>

14:48.300 --> 14:52.490
I was keeping my eye out for you 
and sure enough, you showed up!

14:55.590 --> 14:58.000
Did you just sigh like 
you're some kinda big shot?!

14:58.000 --> 15:00.030
You impertinent cat!

15:00.030 --> 15:02.500
<i>Of course I'd sigh.</i>

15:02.500 --> 15:05.910
Shoo! Shoo!

15:05.910 --> 15:07.420
Shoo! Shoo!

15:09.080 --> 15:10.090
This cat!

15:10.190 --> 15:13.240
You really dragged another 
trash bag over here!

15:13.240 --> 15:16.010
You're just a cat who can't 
even separate the trash!

15:29.660 --> 15:31.730
You got it right today.

15:34.250 --> 15:39.290
<i>I learned something after dealing with that 
worthless human of mine and this old man.</i>

15:39.290 --> 15:44.290
<i>I learned that I am not a stupid cat. 
I am not even a normal cat.</i>

15:44.790 --> 15:47.420
<b>Sparkle</b>

15:44.790 --> 15:48.560
<i>I am the most masterful of all cats!</i>

15:49.720 --> 15:51.800
What a creepy cat.

15:52.190 --> 15:53.800
<i>I'm a masterful cat!</i>

15:54.540 --> 15:57.880
And you're dirty, too! C'mere!

15:57.880 --> 15:59.040
I'll give you a bath!

16:00.660 --> 16:02.420
Don't move now.

16:08.650 --> 16:10.120
There you go!

16:10.820 --> 16:16.370
<b>Dazed...</b>

16:11.530 --> 16:16.530
<i>I will never forget this! 
I will never forget this!</i>

16:15.350 --> 16:17.080
Stay clean now!

16:16.530 --> 16:18.340
<i>I will never!</i>

16:18.560 --> 16:20.540
Hey! Don't make a fuss!

16:20.540 --> 16:23.330
You'll catch a cold if I don't dry your fur!

16:24.240 --> 16:27.090
<i>Today was another terrible encounter.</i>

16:27.850 --> 16:32.360
<i>All of this is that worthless human's fault!</i>

16:36.850 --> 16:40.430
Energy Jelly

16:37.330 --> 16:41.440
<i>That worthless human drinks this a lot.</i>

16:41.440 --> 16:43.930
<i>Is this Churu for humans?</i>

16:45.400 --> 16:50.290
<i>But it seems like she's 
getting weaker by the day.</i>

16:54.750 --> 16:57.090
<i>I have already thrown away all the trash.</i>

16:57.090 --> 16:58.750
<i>I've eliminated all the bugs.</i>

16:58.750 --> 17:01.460
<i>Every day, I open the window 
and let fresh air in.</i>

17:03.030 --> 17:06.270
<i>And yet, this human...</i>

17:12.050 --> 17:15.140
<i>Why doesn't she get any better?</i>

17:18.840 --> 17:20.360
<i>Is she cold?!</i>

17:38.880 --> 17:40.370
Yukichi...

17:42.310 --> 17:46.370
You're so warm. So fluffy...

17:49.880 --> 17:53.840
<b>Yukichi's House</b>

17:50.500 --> 17:56.610
<i>Why is my body so small?</i>

17:59.740 --> 18:01.720
I overslept!

18:05.520 --> 18:07.280
<i>This again...</i>

18:08.270 --> 18:09.730
<b>Plastic</b>

18:08.760 --> 18:12.560
<i>This has the plastic symbol on it, 
so it goes into this bag.</i>

18:13.950 --> 18:17.740
<i>The weather is nice. 
I should open the window today.</i>

18:20.910 --> 18:21.660
<i>Ouch!</i>

18:21.660 --> 18:24.460
<i>I'm out of energy! Why?!</i>

18:24.460 --> 18:28.040
<i>That's because you always only eat sweets!</i>

18:26.200 --> 18:27.420
<i>Yeah. Yeah.</i>

18:28.040 --> 18:31.040
<i>Delicious meals give you power!</i>

18:31.790 --> 18:35.670
<i>But not all foods are the same!</i>

18:35.980 --> 18:40.740
<i>Okay! Everyone watching 
should help us power up, too!</i>

18:40.740 --> 18:42.050
<i>Let's get cooking!</i>

18:42.560 --> 18:45.060
<i>Let's make the world's most powerful food!</i>

18:45.060 --> 18:46.640
<i>Rice balls!</i>

18:48.060 --> 18:49.620
<i>What?</i>

18:50.690 --> 18:52.550
<i>What's that?!</i>

18:50.690 --> 18:54.070
<i>Let's make miso soup with root 
vegetables while we're at it!</i>

18:54.070 --> 18:55.320
<i>Good idea!</i>

18:55.980 --> 18:58.320
<i>All right! Are you all ready?</i>

18:56.510 --> 18:57.600
<i>This...</i>

18:58.980 --> 19:01.540
<i>If I give her this thing called rice balls...</i>

19:02.820 --> 19:07.120
<i>Will my human make a face like that?!</i>

19:12.630 --> 19:15.080
<i>Will she get better?</i>

19:20.780 --> 19:22.350
<i>Just you wait.</i>

19:22.770 --> 19:25.350
<i>Soon, I will be able to make this for you.</i>

19:25.710 --> 19:29.270
<i>I am no normal cat.</i>

19:31.400 --> 19:33.260
<i>After all,</i>

19:35.730 --> 19:41.360
...masterful cat.

19:35.780 --> 19:38.040
<i>I am the most masterful of cats.</i>

19:36.610 --> 19:41.360
I am a...

20:29.150 --> 20:30.200
<i>Thank you!</i>

20:34.590 --> 20:36.210
<i>See you again soon!</i>

21:23.670 --> 21:25.710
I'm home, Yukichi!

21:25.710 --> 21:28.040
What's for dinner tonight?

21:30.600 --> 21:37.020
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>
